2. PRODUCT OVERVIEW

Product Name: FocusLamp

FocusLamp is an IoT-based smart study lamp designed to help students build better study habits, reduce digital distractions, and understand their focus patterns.

The product combines:

- Smart study lamp and physical sensors.
- ESP32-based device communication.
- Focus session management.
- Machine Learning-based analysis.
- Personal study analytics.
- Hybrid AI assistance.
- Gamification and achievements.

The website serves as the product's digital interface and demonstration platform.

Primary target users:

- University students.
- Senior high school and vocational students.
- Independent learners.
- Students who struggle with study consistency and digital distractions.

Product principles:

- Focus on actual study behavior and measurable data.
- Never claim that physical sensors directly measure cognitive attention.
- Provide meaningful insights instead of generic motivational content.
- Keep the experience simple, informative, and accessible.
- Make every feature understandable to first-time users.

