- Avoid duplicate instances during rerenders.
- Clean up properly.
- Support React Router navigation.
- Handle scroll restoration appropriately.
- Preserve keyboard accessibility.
- Avoid interference with nested scrollable elements.
- Do not interfere with modals, dropdowns, chatbot panels, or dashboard charts.

Use natural scrolling for interactive application panels where smooth scrolling would reduce usability.

22.5 Timing and Easing

Recommended timing:

Animation| Duration
Micro-interaction| 120–180ms
Button/toggle| 150–220ms
Content entrance| 180–260ms
Page transition| 220–320ms
Modal/panel| 200–280ms
Stagger delay| 40–70ms

Preferred easing:

cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)

Use opacity and transform for most transitions.

Respect "prefers-reduced-motion".

Avoid:

- Excessive bounce.
- Unnecessary parallax.
- Continuous decorative animation.
- Excessive motion on every scroll.
- Layout-shifting animations.

The experience should feel smooth, effortless, elegant, and polished.

