23. SCROLLBAR DESIGN

Use subtle and functional scrollbars.

Desktop:

- Approximately 4px width.
- Transparent track.
- Low-contrast neutral thumb.
- Slightly more visible on hover or scrolling.

Adapt scrollbar appearance to Light and Dark themes.

Do not hide scrollbars completely when they are needed to communicate scrollable content.

Avoid nested scrollbars unless necessary.

Ensure scrollbar styling does not cause layout shifts.

